    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## DubSync - single shot / single speaker (LatentSync 1.6)\n1. Paste the full path of ONE shot (or a face crop) into *Load Video*.\n2. Paste the matching Hindi **vocals** wav (same start/length) into *Load Audio*.\n3. Queue. Output goes to the path in *Save Video* (relative = ComfyUI/output).\n\nSettings: steps 30-40, guidance 1.5 (2.0 = stronger lips), chunk 48 for 16 GB.\nTwo people in frame? set face_select = nearest_to_target and target_x/y (0-1) on the speaker.\nFor full multi-shot films use DubSync/dubsync.py (automatic shots + speaker detection)."
   ]
  }
